    # ---------------------------------------------------------- strangers & bounties
    {"h3": two("Stranger missions and bounties", "Missions d'inconnus et primes")},
    {"ul": [
        two("Red Dead Redemption: 18 of the game's 19 stranger missions are played as John (all except \"Remember My Family\"): American Appetites, American Lobbyist, Aztec Gold, California, Deadalus and Son, Eva in Peril, Flowers for a Lady, Funny Man, I Know You, Jenny's Faith, Let No Man Put Asunder, Lights, Camera, Action, Love is the Opiate, Poppycock, The Prohibitionist, Water and Honesty, Who Are You to Judge? and The Wronged Woman.",
            "Red Dead Redemption : 18 des 19 missions d'inconnus se jouent avec John (toutes sauf \"Remember My Family\") : American Appetites, American Lobbyist, Aztec Gold, California, Deadalus and Son, Eva in Peril, Flowers for a Lady, Funny Man, I Know You, Jenny's Faith, Let No Man Put Asunder, Lights, Camera, Action, Love is the Opiate, Poppycock, The Prohibitionist, Water and Honesty, Who Are You to Judge? et The Wronged Woman."),
        two("Red Dead Redemption: John takes bounties from wanted posters, bringing targets in dead or alive. The bounty on Mo van Barr is tied to the Deadly Assassin Outfit.",
            "Red Dead Redemption : John accepte des primes affichées sur les avis de recherche et ramène les fugitifs morts ou vifs. La prime sur Mo van Barr est liée à la tenue Deadly Assassin."),
        two("Red Dead Redemption 2, epilogue: stranger missions left unfinished by Arthur can be completed as John, among them \"The Noblest of Men, and a Woman\" (John asks the biographer Theodore Levin to send the money to \"Jim Milton\"). Charlotte Balfour can be visited at her cabin, where John tells her of Arthur's death.",
            "Red Dead Redemption 2, épilogue : les missions d'inconnus laissées inachevées par Arthur peuvent être terminées avec John, dont \"The Noblest of Men, and a Woman\" (John demande au biographe Theodore Levin d'envoyer l'argent à \"Jim Milton\"). John peut rendre visite à Charlotte Balfour dans sa cabane et lui annoncer la mort d'Arthur."),
        two("Red Dead Redemption 2, epilogue: besides Sadie's bounty missions, John can take wanted posters, among them Lindsey Wofford (Saint Denis, $100), Esteban Cortez (Tumbleweed, $65, hiding at Gaptooth Breach after his brother Ramón's capture), Bart Cavanaugh (Strawberry, after \"Gainful Employment\"), Elias Green and Otis Skinner (Blackwater) and Camille de Millemont.",
            "Red Dead Redemption 2, épilogue : en plus des missions de Sadie, John peut suivre des avis de recherche, dont Lindsey Wofford (Saint-Denis, 100 $), Esteban Cortez (Tumbleweed, 65 $, caché à Gaptooth Breach après la capture de son frère Ramón), Bart Cavanaugh (Strawberry, après \"Gainful Employment\"), Elias Green et Otis Skinner (Blackwater) et Camille de Millemont."),
    ]},

